<title>UK: Pakistan to launch $300 mln 3-year FRN Tuesday - ANZ.</title>
<headline>Pakistan to launch $300 mln 3-year FRN Tuesday - ANZ.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan will launch its $300 million three-year floating rate note on Tuesday, lead manager ANZ Investment Bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>The deal will be priced with a coupon of U.S. dollar libor plus 395 basis points at an issue and fixed re-offer price of 99.90, it said. --London newsroom,  +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
